<p></p>
<h1 id=3D"UpgradeFeature-Context">Context</h1>
<p>Feature:<span>&nbsp;</span><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://nb=
in.aha.io/epics/FUM-E-105" rel=3D"nofollow">FUM-E-105 Manage feature | Aha!=
</a></p>
<p>Feature Architecture:&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/display/NA/Fea=
ture+Management" rel=3D"nofollow">Feature Management - NBIN Architecture - =
Confluence (bnc.ca)</a></p>
<p>Epic:&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://nbin.aha.io/featur=
es/FUM-193" rel=3D"nofollow">FUM-193 Manage feature upgrades | Aha!</a></p>
<p>Design:<span>&nbsp;</span><a href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/display/NWPI/Ac=
cess+Control+-+Managing+Feature+Package+Updates" rel=3D"nofollow">Access Co=
ntrol - Managing Feature Package Updates - NBIN - Web Platform and IAM - Co=
nfluence (bnc.ca)</a></p>
<h1 id=3D"UpgradeFeature-TacticalSolution">Tactical Solution</h1>
<p>As per the assessment <a href=3D"/spaces/NA/pages/1749313064/Feature+Man=
agement">AA.003</a></p>
<div class=3D"rwui_tabs">
 <ul class=3D"rwui_tabs_menu">
  <!-- These will be generated by the js -->
 </ul><!-- Here will the tabs go -->
 <div class=3D"rwui_tab_content" data-name=3D"Use Cases" data-hash=3D"tab-U=
se+Cases">
  <p>&nbsp;<img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"468" style=3D"width=
:841px;max-width: 100%;" src=3D"d7460372e24f20fb39ed465e583097e99fad67ad79d=
d5e8cdb7577d59af9e286" height=3D"195"></p>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"rwui_tab_content" data-name=3D"Functional Requirements" data=
-hash=3D"tab-Functional+Requirements">
  <div class=3D"table-wrap">
   <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: =
75.2995%;">
    <colgroup>
     <col style=3D"width: 4.95391%;">
     <col style=3D"width: 95.0461%;">
    </colgroup>
    <tbody>
     <tr>
      <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">No.</th>
      <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.001</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Updates must be limited to a&nbsp;<u><stro=
ng>single</strong></u> (<em>user</em> | <em>firm</em>) <em>template</em> at=
 a time (i.e. 1 update file : 1 <em>template</em>)</td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.002</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <p>Only <em>resources</em> with <em>permissions</em> from the <u><st=
rong>same</strong> <strong><em>capability</em></strong></u> as one of the e=
xisting <em>roles</em> assigned to the <em>template</em>'s <em>user-group</=
em>&nbsp;can be added.</p>
       <p><strong>N.B. </strong>As per the assessment <a href=3D"/spaces/NA=
/pages/1749313064/Feature+Management">AA.003</a>, <em>scopes</em> cannot be=
 updated dynamically in Okta. Therefore, the <em>roles</em> must not be mod=
ified dynamically in Compass X for a <em>template</em>.</p></td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.003</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
        <p>The following is the (<em>user</em> | <em>firm</em>) <em>templat=
e</em> JSON object schema for <u>adding</u> <strong>new <em>resources</em><=
/strong>:</p>
        <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
         <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
          <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-param=
s=3D"brush: xml; gutter: true">{
 &nbsp;"packageTemplateName": "",
&nbsp; "description": "",
  "type": "",
  "firmType": "",
  "active": true|false,
  "feature": [
    {
      "assignmentType": "",
      "assignmentMode": "",
      "selectionDefault": true|false,
      "resourceName": "",
      "permissionNames": [""] --Discarded. Ref. TD.001
    }
  ],
  "firm": {
    "firmId": "",
    "selected": true|false
  }
}</pre>
         </div>
        </div>
        <p><br></p>
       </div></td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.004</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
        <p>The following is the (<em>user</em> | <em>firm</em>) <em>templat=
e</em> JSON object schema for <u>removing</u> <strong>existing <em>resource=
s</em></strong>:</p>
        <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
         <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
          <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-param=
s=3D"brush: xml; gutter: true">{
 &nbsp;"packageTemplateName": "",=20
&nbsp; "resourceNames": [""]
}</pre>
         </div>
        </div>
       </div></td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.005</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
        <p>Upon upload, the design validation requirements must be enforced=
 by the business logic</p>
        <p>Ref. <a href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/display/NWPI/Access+Control+=
-+Managing+Feature+Package+Updates#AccessControlManagingFeaturePackageUpdat=
es-Whatpackagepropertiescanbeupdated?" rel=3D"nofollow">Access Control - Ma=
naging Feature Package Updates - NBIN - Web Platform and IAM - Confluence (=
bnc.ca)</a></p>
       </div></td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.006</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
        <p><em>Resource:Permission</em> mapping to be created and maintaine=
d in the database and made accessible to BSAs and TechLeads.</p>
        <p>p.s. Currently, the mapping exists in the frontend and backend o=
nly. (ref. see Appendix&nbsp;<a href=3D"#UpgradeFeature-accesscontrols">Acc=
ess Controls</a>). Here's the&nbsp;related Jira ticket: <a class=3D"externa=
l-link" href=3D"https://jira.bnc.ca/browse/NWPI-10539" rel=3D"nofollow">[NW=
PI-10539] Resource/Permission Validation (Tech Debt) - Jira (bnc.ca)</a></p=
>
       </div></td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.007</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <p>Upon the upload of a <em>user</em> <em>template</em> update file =
(JSON), <u>adding</u> a <strong>new <em>resource</em> (or more) </strong>to=
 a&nbsp;<strong><u>single</u> <em>user template</em></strong>, sequence the=
 following:</p>
       <ol>
        <li>Update the <em>user </em><em>template</em>
         <ol>
          <li>Update the <em>user </em><em>template</em> details</li>
          <li>Create a <strong>new <em>feature</em> </strong>assigning the =
<strong>new <em>resource</em></strong> to the <em>user </em><em>template</e=
m></li>
          <li><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">Update the <em>user </em><em>t=
emplate</em>'s <em>user-group </em>(<strong>N.B.</strong> Discarded as per =
TD.001)</span><br>
           <ol>
            <li><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">Add the <strong>new <em>reso=
urce</em></strong>'s <em>permission</em> to the <em>role</em> from the same=
 <em>capability</em> (if not already done)</span></li>
           </ol></li>
         </ol></li>
        <li>Update every <em>user package</em> associated to the <em>user t=
emplate</em>
         <ol>
          <li>Add the <strong>new <em>feature</em></strong> to the <em>user=
 package</em>
           <ol>
            <li>Flag as <strong>selected</strong> following the <em>templat=
e's selection default </em>value</li>
           </ol></li>
          <li>Update the assignment of&nbsp;<em>user </em><em>package</em>'=
s <em>user</em>&nbsp;=20
           <ol>
            <li>Create a <strong>new assignment</strong>, assigning the <st=
rong>new <em>resource</em></strong> to the <em>user</em> <u>on the conditio=
n of</u>:=20
             <ol>
              <li>The <strong>new <em>resource</em></strong> is already ass=
igned to the <em>user's firm's firm package</em></li>
             </ol></li>
           </ol></li>
         </ol></li>
       </ol></td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.008</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <p>Upon the upload of a <em>user</em> <em>template</em> update file =
(JSON), <u>removing</u> an&nbsp;<strong>existing </strong><strong><em>resou=
rce</em> (or more) </strong>from a&nbsp;<strong><u>single</u><em>&nbsp;user=
 template</em></strong>, sequence the following:</p>
       <ol>
        <li>Update the <em>user </em><em>template</em>
         <ol>
          <li>Update every <em>user package</em> associated to the <em>user=
 template</em>
           <ol>
            <li>Remove the<strong><em> feature</em></strong> (assigning the=
 <strong>existing <em>resource</em></strong>) from the <em>user </em><em>pa=
ckage</em></li>
            <li>Update the <em>user </em><em>package</em>'s user assignment=
=20
             <ol>
              <li>Remove the <strong>resource assignment</strong> from&nbsp=
;the <em>user</em></li>
             </ol></li>
           </ol></li>
          <li>Remove the<strong><em> feature </em></strong>(assigning the <=
strong>existing <em>resource</em></strong>) from the <em>user </em><em>temp=
late</em></li>
          <li><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">Update the <em>user-group</em>=
 of the <em>user template</em> <span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">(<strong>N.B.=
</strong> Discarded as per TD.001)</span></span><br>
           <ol>
            <li><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">Remove the <strong>existing<=
/strong><strong>&nbsp;<em>resource</em></strong>'s <em>permissions</em></sp=
an></li>
           </ol></li>
         </ol></li>
       </ol></td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.009</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <p>Upon the upload of a <em>firm</em> <em>template</em> update file =
(JSON), <u>adding</u> a <strong>new <em>resource (or more)</em></strong><em=
> </em>to a<strong><em>&nbsp;<u>single</u> firm template</em></strong>, seq=
uence the following:</p>
       <ol>
        <li>Update the <em>firm </em><em>template</em>
         <ol>
          <li>Update the <em>firm </em><em>template</em> details</li>
          <li>Create a <strong>new <em>feature</em> </strong>assigning the =
<strong>new <em>resource</em></strong> to the <em>firm </em><em>template</e=
m></li>
         </ol></li>
        <li>Update every <em>firm package</em> associated to the <em>firm t=
emplate</em>
         <ol>
          <li>Add the <strong>new <em>feature</em></strong> to the <em>firm=
 package</em>, flagged as <strong>selected</strong></li>
          <li>Update the assignments of the <em>firm</em>'s <em>users</em>
           <ol>
            <li>Update the <em>user</em>'s resource assignment=20
             <ol>
              <li>Create a <strong>new assignment</strong>, assigning the <=
strong>new <em>resource</em></strong> to the <em>user </em><u>on the condit=
ion of</u>:=20
               <ol>
                <li>The <strong>new <em>resource</em></strong> is already a=
ssigned to the <em>firm's user's user package</em></li>
               </ol></li>
             </ol></li>
           </ol></li>
         </ol></li>
       </ol></td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.010</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <p>Upon the upload of a <em>firm</em> <em>template</em> update file =
(JSON), <u>removing</u> an <strong>existing <em>resource</em> (or more)</st=
rong> from a <strong><u>single</u></strong><strong><em> firm template</em><=
/strong>, sequence the following:</p>
       <ol>
        <li>Update the <em>firm </em><em>template</em>
         <ol>
          <li>Update every <em>firm package</em> associated to the <em>firm=
 template</em>
           <ol>
            <li>Remove the<strong><em> feature</em></strong> (assigning the=
 <strong>existing <em>resource</em></strong>) from the <em>firm </em><em>pa=
ckage</em></li>
           </ol></li>
          <li>Remove the<strong><em> feature </em></strong>(assigning the <=
strong>existing <em>resource</em></strong>) from the <em>firm </em><em>temp=
late</em></li>
         </ol></li>
       </ol></td>
     </tr>
    </tbody>
   </table>
  </div>
  <p><br></p>
 </div>
 <p><br></p>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"UpgradeFeature-TechnicalDebts">Technical Debts</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 91=
.185%;">
  <colgroup class=3D"">
   <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 8.40233%;">
   <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 79.1292%;">
   <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 12.5242%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">No.</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Jira</th>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">TD.001</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>The <em>permissions</em> won't be specified in the JSON object as =
the BSA don't necessarily have knowledge of the required <em>permissions</e=
m> for a given <em>resource</em> to be assigned to a <em>template</em>. Fur=
thermore, it is unclear if <em>permissions</em> are specific to a single <e=
m>resource</em> or several, which would be an anomaly. Therefore, the assum=
ption is:</p>
      <ul>
       <li>&nbsp;:warning: Every <em>template</em> has all the necessary <e=
m>permissions</em> it might need for a predefined set of <em>resources</em>=
, some of which might not be assigned yet. :warning:&nbsp;</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The consequence is:</p>
      <ul>
       <li>:warning: No <em>permission</em> will be added/removed when addi=
ng/removing <em>resources</em> to a <em>template</em>. Both <strong>roles &=
amp; permissions</strong> are <u><strong>immutable</strong></u> :warning:</=
li>
      </ul>
      <p><br></p>
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: xml; gutter: true">{
 &nbsp;"packageTemplateName": "",
&nbsp; "description": "",
  "type": "",
  "firmType": "",
  "active": true|false,
  "feature": [
    {
      "assignmentType": "",
      "assignmentMode": "",
      "selectionDefault": true|false,
      "resourceName": ""
    }
  ]
}</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">TODO <a class=3D"confluence-userlin=
k user-mention" data-username=3D"piej002" href=3D"/display/~piej002" data-l=
